{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-06. It distinguishes missing from explicit null via a key-presence guard before reading the value, accepts exact integer 2..11 only, and returns {kind,offset} in every branch. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation occurred; target typed inputs needs selected-runner support.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-06", "description": "Classify raw offset: missing -> {kind:"missing",offset:null}; explicit null -> {kind:"null",offset:null}; exact integer 2..11 -> {kind:"integer",offset:original}; other -> {kind:"invalid",offset:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. Uses a helper invoked at module scope; assigns its returned object to result. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 required.", "content": "def classify_offset(raw):
    if 'offset' not in raw:
        return {'kind': 'missing', 'offset': None}
    value = raw['offset']
    if value is None:
        return {'kind': 'null', 'offset': None}
    if type(value) is int and 2 <= value <= 11:
        return {'kind': 'integer', 'offset': value}
    return {'kind': 'invalid', 'offset': None}
result = classify_offset(inputs)"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
